    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#F59E0B'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">结构</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">    x_concat → block_5_conv_2 (Conv 3×3) → Sigmoid → x_g [B,1,H,W]</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">监督目标</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">    gt_grad = normalized_sobel_magnitude(input_img)</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">    监督的是“输入图”的 Sobel 梯度, 而不是“目标漫反射”的梯度</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">训练损失</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    l_grad (SSIM)、l_grad_edge (Charbonnier with edge weight)、l_grad_spec (用输入高亮先验约束 g 与 b 边界关系)</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">下游消费者</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    1) EnhancementLayers 的 edge_gate; 2) MainDecoder 三路先验调制中的 grad_gate 与 joint_gate; 3) MainDecoder L5 与 cat(gradient g) 直接拼接</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 40f927df59271351b6d9123926b8da5a8b6f45c8d71d14876fe6a8edc0902c40
