      - 410.4
      - 349.2
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#7C3AED'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">结构</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">    x_concat → Conv 3×3 (→32ch) → Conv 3×3 (→16ch) → Conv 5×5 (→1ch) → Sigmoid → x_s [B,1,H,W]</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">监督目标</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">    gt_specular = clamp(input - target, 0, 1)</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">    输入中比目标多出来的高反光成分, 作为高光位置软标签</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">训练损失</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    l_s_lik (BCE + SSIM)、l_s_cons (s 与 b 在高反光区域的双向一致性约束)</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">下游消费者</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    1) EnhancementLayers 的 specular_gate (与 g、x 联合); 2) MainDecoder 三路先验中的 joint_gate 与 spec_lik_gate; 3) 训练损失中作为高光区域定位线索</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 1ceab48cfab83fa0d4df6d28ab836227115c009d90b70b2443e259180791dd40
